\b 4) Next Steps - Prioritized by Impact\b0\par
\par
\b TIER 1: Production Safety (Before Real Money)\b0\par
1) Global exception handler on FastAPI (2h)\par
   Why: Prevent raw tracebacks leaking to clients; standardize clean 500 response envelopes\par
\par
2) LTP zero-guard (1h)\par
   Why: Block order flow when LTP unavailable or invalid (<=0)\par
\par
3) Authentication / Login (4-6h)\par
   Why: No auth means any local-network user can access trading endpoints\par
\par
4) API key encryption at rest (2-3h)\par
   Why: Zerodha credentials in plain env are high-risk\par
\par
5) Emergency \ldblquote Close All\rdblquote button (3h)\par
   Why: One-click panic flatten for live and paper positions\par
\par
6) Real Market Depth (2h)\par
   Why: Replace random output with Zerodha quote depth payload\par
\par
